        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Chamloumei Guang puan e Bethlehem khou,",
            "Hei 5#^ ramla liangmei kanan ram e;",
            "Jat guaina rui tan rui tat guangtang nu e,",
            "Thu 5#^ ringmei dui nthanna luange.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "He lung neilana guang nganah puan puinung,",
            "Neilana suanno lung neila thaona;",
            "Jat kapumma khang rui puan pui tuange,",
            "Thuanno, thuanno hallelujah tuna.",
            "",
            "2. Tingsei jingbang phuairiao gaimei ding khou,",
            "Laujiu gangmei rui laujiu gang ban khou;",
            "Jipchung kan khou gabriel rui kei ndaona,",
            "Ringpui lat gaimei phung keilou du e.",
            "",
            "3. Khou 5#^ tingkau thu bumang thanmei nun rui,",
            "Kei ndaona kau luh gaimei suan ne;",
            "Thuaihian liangmei poubaumei tikgun daidiu,",
            "Kandih khou ni lung gaimei padik diu.",
            "",
            "4. Laujiu gangmei nun rui namdai juanna,",
            "Salem ntak meinun ni njuan ne;",
            "Lungsimei nun rui kaniu muang rui kalum,",
            "Lung gaimei guai ni lanh khuk lan guange.",
            "",
            "5. Neila kho kau le kandih guang puan nung,",
            "Tingkau le kandih rui khuang hiu cham diu;",
            "Guang guaina guang poubaumei thuaihian liangmei,",
            "Aniu panti nganna thuan kho Guang khrista."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
